{"last_link_id": 5, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [270, 270], "pos": [1727.8048095703125, 530.77685546875], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 4, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}], "flags": {}, "id": 5, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [4, 5], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}], "size": [400, 358], "pos": [831.9127197265625, 513.9630126953125], "widgets_values": ["超高清，高质量，8K，HDR，这是一张以“秋天的第一杯奶茶”为主题的现代都市风海报。\n\n一位白皙嫩滑的手部特写，正手持一杯渐变色奶茶，饮品呈现温暖的黄色与粉色/橙色渐变，视觉诱人；杯身清晰贴有“秋天的第一杯奶茶”中文字样，杯盖上放置一个可爱的卡通动物或小熊玩偶，增添童趣感；配有白色吸管，手部佩戴时尚手链或手表等精致配饰；背景为秋日都市街景，落叶纷飞，梧桐树金黄，街道清晰繁华但略微虚化，突出主体；整体画面色彩明亮、温暖治愈，风格为高清写实，分辨率极高，细节清晰，光影自然，突出秋日仪式感与温馨氛围。\n\n\n整体画面色彩清晰明艳，光影通透，细节极致——从手部肌肤的微小绒毛、饮品杯壁的水珠反光，到玩偶毛发的根根分明，全部清晰可见。风格为现代少女风 × 城市轻奢感，传递“仪式感入秋，甜蜜即刻拥有”的情绪，极具社交传播力与种草吸引力。", 704, 1280, 20, 4, 200497820056232, "randomize", "auto", "custom", "", true], "inputs": [{"name": "pipeline", "link": 1, "label": "pipeline", "type": "QWEN_PIPELINE", "localized_name": "pipeline"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "link": 2, "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "link": 3, "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "num_inference_steps"}, "name": "num_inference_steps", "label": "num_inference_steps", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "num_inference_steps"}, {"widget": {"name": "true_cfg_scale"}, "name": "true_cfg_scale", "label": "true_cfg_scale", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "true_cfg_scale"}, {"widg